  "body": "You will fall in love with this classic renovated villa nestled in a quiet street close to Devonport village on a freehold 465sqm safely fenced section. Offering you the perfect blend of timeless character and modern living you will enjoy the convenience of being close to shops, cafes, restaurants, the library, supermarket and the ferry for easy city access.\r\nStep inside from the front veranda to discover beautiful original villa features including high ceilings, timber detailing, and stunning leadlight windows that fill the home with natural light and charm.\r\nThe open-plan designer kitchen is the hub of this home with the lounge and dining area opening through extra height bi-fold doors to a sheltered sunny deck and the private, lush garden. The perfect place for your children to play freely on the lawn and for your family to relax surrounded by established greenery with the soothing sounds of a water feature. \r\nThis spacious home offers three double bedrooms, including a charming master suite with an ensuite and walk-in wardrobe. One bedroom is currently used as a living room, providing flexible space to suit your family’s needs.\r\nThere is a family bathroom, laundry and a big garage for convenience. Close to highly regarded schools, this much-loved home is ready for you to move into as the current owner is committed to downsizing.\r\nIf you’re seeking a quintessential Devonport lifestyle in a quiet, convenient location with character and space, this villa is a rare find.\r\nContact us today to arrange a viewing and make this charming home yours!",
